---
/**
 * The early-access form, once for the whole site.
 *
 * Three different versions of this were live at the same time: the homepage
 * asked for carrera and ciclo, the blog asked for less, and the product pages
 * for something else again — so the same visitor was worth different data
 * depending on where they clicked. This is the homepage version, which is the
 * one the pilot actually needs, and now there is only one to change.
 *
 * app.js wires it up by class and id (.founder-dialog, #founder-form,
 * #form-status, .turnstile-slot, [data-close-founder], #founder-toast); those
 * hooks are load-bearing, not decoration.
 */
---

<dialog class="founder-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title">
      <button class="dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="Cerrar" data-close-founder><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/assets/lucide.svg#x"></use></svg></button>
      <p class="eyebrow">Campus Plus</p>
      <h2 id="dialog-title">Da el siguiente paso con Plus.</h2>
      <p>Primeros 25 usuarios de pago: <strong>S/5 el primer mes y luego S/10 al mes.</strong> Al completar ese grupo, nuevas suscripciones a <strong>S/15 al mes desde el primer mes.</strong></p>
      <p>Déjanos tus datos. Te escribiremos por WhatsApp para confirmar la tarifa disponible y coordinar tu acceso. Enviar este formulario no reserva un cupo promocional.</p>
      <form id="founder-form">
        <div class="founder-form__grid">
          <label>Nombre<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label>
          <label>WhatsApp<input name="whatsapp" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="+51 999 999 999" required /></label>
        </div>
        <div class="founder-form__grid founder-form__grid--study">
          <label>Carrera<input name="career" autocomplete="organization-title" placeholder="Ej. Ingeniería de Software" required /></label>
          <label>Ciclo<select name="cycle" required><option value="" selected disabled>Elige</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option><option value="11">11</option><option value="12">12</option></select></label>
        </div>
        <label>¿Qué quieres usar primero?<select name="intent"><option>Profes y horarios para mi matrícula</option><option>Mis cursos y tareas de Blackboard</option><option>Notas y anuncios de Blackboard</option><option>Todo Campus</option></select></label>
        <label class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Sitio web<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
        <div class="turnstile-slot" aria-label="Verificación de seguridad"></div>
        <button class="button button--full" type="submit">Quiero Campus Plus <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/assets/lucide.svg#arrow-right"></use></svg></button>
      </form>
      <p class="form-note" id="form-note"><span class="desktop-copy">Tus datos se usan solo para coordinar Campus. Te escribiré por WhatsApp al número indicado.</span><span class="mobile-copy">Usaremos tus datos solo para coordinar tu acceso.</span></p>
      <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </dialog>

<div class="toast" id="founder-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" hidden>
      <span class="toast__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/assets/lucide.svg#check"></use></svg></span>
      <span><strong>Recibimos tu solicitud de Plus</strong><small>Te escribiré por WhatsApp pronto.</small></span>
    </div>
